# Variable NAMES only, never values. Values go in .env.local (ignored by Git), the preview host and EAS.
# Where the app reads its data: "demo" (invented data in memory) or "supabase". Used from phase 0.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DATA_SOURCE=
# Public Supabase values (safe in the app). Used from phase 1; see docs/SETUP_SUPABASE.md.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
